{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"32":"Chapters on Dress"},"section_detail":{"32":{"hadithnumber_first":3550,"hadithnumber_last":3656,"arabicnumber_first":3550,"arabicnumber_last":3656,"name_native":"كتاب اللباس"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3615,"arabicnumber":3615,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا يزيد بن هارون، عن همام، عن قتادة، عن انس، قال كان لنعل النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم قبالان","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari"}],"reference":{"book":32,"hadith":66}}]}